{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09339","headline":"观田家 · 韦应物","name":"观田家","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"微雨衆卉新，一雷惊蛰始。\n田家几日闲，耕种从此起。\n丁壮俱在野，场圃亦就理。\n归来景常晏，饮犊西涧水。\n饥劬不自苦，膏泽且爲喜。\n仓廪无宿储，徭役犹未已。\n方慙不耕者，禄食出闾里。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09339.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09339","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}